              "id": "attorney_body",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>At McMillen Legal, we specialize in high-stakes defense across complex federal and state jurisdictions. Our trial experience ranges from white-collar offenses and federal multi-defendant conspiracies to serious felonies and misdemeanors. Every case receives micro-focused asset investigations and partner-level tactical execution.</p>",
